              "source_texts": [
                "{i}The long-lost cousin, the bad news, the twenty-six hours of bus rides with countless late-night stops in seedy depots that would have felt unsafe even in the middle of the day. You wouldn’t normally find yourself traveling like this, but your cousin bought the tickets.{/i}"
